 [; §4.2 closed unit-interval contract: :cosine over identical token
    multisets must print exactly 1.0 — the scorer clamps the float
    dot-product overshoot (was 1.0000000000000002 before the clamp). ]
 [case id=similar-024-score-cosine-identical-unit-range level=core
